      "content": "i know about the hotlines, i've looked at them. they don't pay the mortgage. they don't fix the fact that i'm a complete failure who ruined my family's entire future. there's no \"next step\" when you're at zero. i've crunched the numbers a thousand times. it's not even a struggle at this point, it's just a fact. i'm just stuck in this loop of shame and debt and there's literally nothing left to do.",
